      55.05,
      543.61,
      295.32,
      578.68
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.17,
      589.21,
      223.91,
      600.28
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      607.21,
      295.1,
      702.28
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 1 allotments in total extent of about 0.0962 Hectare,of land in Preliminary Plan No. Mara 2765 and dated 09.01.2019prepared by the Senior - Superintendent of Surveys of MataraDistrict on behalf of Surveyor General, situated in the GramaNiladhari Division of No. 327 B, Walakanda East in the villageof Bajjankale in Minor Division of Gangabada Paththuwa inthe Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kirinda Puhulwella inMatara District in the Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      711.61,
      295.11,
      746.68
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Gahalakolamadiththa; Description: Containsa garden, mixed cultivation; Claimant: Kodithuwakkuge",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.05,
      457.21,
      547.06,
      492.28
    ],
    "text": "Piyadasa, \"Wijaya\", Gahalakolamadiththa, Walakanda;Original Claimant: - (Parts of the Hi.P. 230525 and Hi.P. 230839);Extent: 0.0962 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.05,
      501.61,
      547.1,
      608.68
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the afore said lands are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agent duly authorized inwriting, before me at Divisional Secretariat Office of KirindaPuhulwella on the from 21.03.2019 at 10.00 a.m and are herebyrequested to notify to me in writing in duplicate) on or beforethe 14.03.2019 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said lands, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
